# `git.diff`

Diff for a commit or 'WORKING'.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.git.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `commit` | `string` |
| `workspace_id` | `string` |

## Returns

`GitDiffResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `sha` | `string` |
| `short_sha` | `string` |
| `is_working` | `bool` |
| `diff_text` | `string` |
| `parsed` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call git.diff --json '{ "commit": "", "workspace_id": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "sha": "a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9012345678",
  "short_sha": "a1b2c3d",
  "is_working": false,
  "diff_text": "diff --git a/crates/core/ship-platform/src/services/checkout.rs b/crates/core/ship-platform/src/services/checkout.rs\nnew file mode 100644\n+++ b/crates/core/ship-platform/src/services/checkout.rs\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+pub struct CheckoutService;\n+\n+impl CheckoutService {}\n",
  "parsed": {
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "crates/core/ship-platform/src/services/checkout.rs",
        "additions": 3,
        "deletions": 0,
        "hunks": [
          {
            "header": "@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@",
            "lines": [
              {
                "kind": "add",
                "content": "pub struct CheckoutService;",
                "new_num": 1
              },
              {
                "kind": "add",
                "content": "",
                "new_num": 2
              },
              {
                "kind": "add",
                "content": "impl CheckoutService {}",
                "new_num": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "total_additions": 3,
    "total_deletions": 0
  }
}
```
